*   **Font**: Changed from system fonts to `Inter` via Google Fonts.
*   **Screener Tabs**: Transformed the sidebar into a horizontally swipeable/scrollable `div` using `overflow-x: auto; white-space: nowrap;`.
*   **Dropdowns**: Added functional "⋮" (More Options) buttons and an "Indicators ▾" menu on the main toolbar to toggle technical overlays seamlessly without reloading the UI.
