## 39. Value & Foreign Flow Stacked Bar Indicator Architecture Standards

- **Indicator Concept & Formulation**:
  - An institutional turnover indicator displaying transaction **Value (IDR)** instead of share volume, providing an exact breakdown of Domestic vs. Foreign participation.
  - **Stacked Vertical Bar Chart**:
    - **Base (Blue)**: Represents Domestic / remainder turnover value (`Total Value - (Foreign Buy + Foreign Sell)` in Gross mode, or `Total Value - |Net Foreign|` in Net mode) positioned at the floor of each bar. Default color: `#2962FF` (Royal Blue).
    - **Foreign Sell (Red)**: Plotted directly above the Base segment. Styled with `#FF5252` (exact same red as candlestick downColor).
    - **Foreign Buy (Green)**: Plotted on top of the Foreign Sell segment (or top of the bar). Styled with `#4CAF50` (exact same green as candlestick upColor).
    - Total bar height equals 100% of the session's turnover value ($\text{Total Value} = \text{Base} + \text{FSell} + \text{FBuy}$).
- **Dual-Scale Multi-Indicator Overlay Architecture**:
  - **Average Turnover Line (MA Line)**: Plotted on the Right Price Scale as a simple moving average (SMA) of total turnover value (default period 20, `#FF9800` amber line).
  - **Net Foreign % of Total Value Line**: Plotted on the pane's independent **Left Price Scale**, calculating $\text{NF\%} = \frac{\text{Net Foreign}}{\text{Total Value}} \times 100\%$. Rendered as an oscillator line (`#9C27B0`) with a dashed 0% horizontal reference level (`rgba(120, 123, 134, 0.4)`).
- **Custom Canvas Series Primitive (`value-flow-primitive.ts`)**:
  - Implements Lightweight Charts v5 `ISeriesPrimitive<Time>`, `IPrimitivePaneView`, and `IPrimitivePaneRenderer` via `fancy-canvas`.
  - Calculates dynamic bar width based on chart time scale spacing, incorporates viewport culling to render only visible bars, and draws crisp rectangular segments (`ctx.fillRect`) with sub-pixel alignment for 60 FPS performance.
  - Transparent anchor line series (`LineSeries` with `color: 'transparent'`, `lastValueVisible: false`, `priceLineVisible: false`) binds the primitive to the target pane coordinate space and manages right price scale auto-scaling and margins.
- **Dynamic Multi-Pane Stretch Factors & Rebalancing (`adjustMultiPaneStretchFactors`)**:
  - Automatically balances layout whether 1, 2, or 3 panes are concurrently active:
    - 1 pane (Price only): `panes[0].setStretchFactor(1000)`
    - 2 panes (Price + Volume OR Price + Value): `panes[0].setStretchFactor(650)`, `panes[1].setStretchFactor(350)`
    - 3 panes (Price + Volume + Value): `panes[0].setStretchFactor(550)`, `panes[1].setStretchFactor(225)`, `panes[2].setStretchFactor(225)`
  - Seamlessly coordinates with Volume pane when either pane is added, removed, moved up/down, collapsed, restored, or maximized.
- **Interactive Top-Left Legend, Pane Controls & Settings Modal**:
  - **Pill Legend (`#value-pane-legend`)**: Compact card displaying `Tot`, `Dom` (base), `FSell`, `FBuy`, `Avg [len]`, and `NF%` with live color badges. Includes `👁` hide/show, `⚙` settings modal, `🗑` delete pane, and `···` more menu.
  - **Pane Utility Toolbar (`#value-pane-controls`)**: Positioned dynamically next to pane divider with Move Up/Down, Delete, Collapse (28px height), and Maximize (1000/0 stretch factor).
  - **Context Dropdown (`#value-pane-menu`)**: Quick actions for moving, configuring, and removing the pane.
  - **Settings Modal (`#tv-value-settings-modal`)**:
    - Inputs Tab: MA Length (numeric), Calculation Mode (`Gross (Total - Buy - Sell)` vs `Net (Total - |Net Foreign|)`).
    - Style Tab: Color pickers for Base (Blue), Foreign Buy (Green), Foreign Sell (Red), Average Line, and Net Foreign % Line.
    - Configuration persists in `localStorage['user_value_flow_settings']`.
- **Crosshair & Lifecycle Synchronization**:
  - Timestamp-indexed lookup map `valueDataMap: Map<Time, ValueFlowMetrics>` ensures $O(1)$ value retrieval during crosshair movement.
  - Updates gated by `requestAnimationFrame` to avoid layout thrashing.
  - Memory cleared cleanly on timeframe switching and ticker change.
- **Build Status**:
  - `npm run build` (`tsc`): 0 compilation errors.

