    2. `data/ihsg_list.csv`
  - Normalized indices to hyphenated format: replaced all underscores `_` with hyphens `-` (`IDXSMC-COM`, `IDXSMC-LIQ`, `I-GRADE`, `SRI-KEHATI`) and formatted `BISNIS27` as `BISNIS-27`.
  - Added indices (38): `LQ45`, `IDX30`, `IDX80`, `IDXSMC-COM`, `IDXSMC-LIQ`, `IDXHIDIV20`, `IDXBUMN20`, `IDXG30`, `IDXV30`, `IDXQ30`, `IDXESGL`, `IDXLQ45LCL`, `IDXMESBUMN`, `JII`, `JII70`, `ISSI`, `KOMPAS100`, `MNC36`, `INVESTOR33`, `BISNIS-27`, `PEFINDO25`, `I-GRADE`, `SMINFRA18`, `SRI-KEHATI`, `IDXPEFINDOPB`, `MBX`, `DBX`, `IDXENERGY`, `IDXBASIC`, `IDXINDUST`, `IDXCYCLIC`, `IDXNONCYC`, `IDXHEALTH`, `IDXFINANCE`, `IDXPROPERT`, `IDXTECHNO`, `IDXINFRA`, `IDXTRANS`.
  - Total universe expanded from 754 tickers to 793 symbols (794 lines including `symbol` header).
  - Preserves compatibility with all scrapers (`stockbit_daily_historical_scraper.py`, `stockbit_intraday_scraper.py`, `stockbit_broker_summary_scraper.py`, `populate_watchlist.py`).

