## 35. Fundamental Analysis & Financial Statements Integration (IDXEDGEPRO REST API)

### A. Feature Overview & Objectives
Integrated the fundamental financial statements endpoint from IDXEDGEPRO (`https://stock.arjum.com/api/financial-statements/{code}`) into the platform, completing the `Financials & Ratios` button on the Stockbit right vertical icon dock.

### B. Architecture & Data Flow
1. **Right Dock Activation**:
