   - Added `#sidebar.expanded { width: 580px; }` with dedicated toggle button `⤢` in the drawer header and financial controls. Automatically opens in expanded mode when entering financials.
9. **Indonesian Currency Nominal Formatting (`formatRupiahFin`)**:
