## 64. TradingView Terminal Visual Hierarchy & Framing Overhaul (Structural Layout Parity)

- **Root Cause & Architectural Shift**:
  - The previous implementation suffered from structural flatness: the chart canvas was visually borderless, the grid was turned off (`visible: false`), the price and time scale lacked explicit border framing, the left toolbar was too narrow (45px) with empty bottom space, the bottom bar was incomplete, and the top-left legend was a single flat line of text.
  - Re-architected the viewport into coordinated, distinct terminal chrome layers mirroring authentic TradingView:
    1. **Top Application Chrome (`#tv-header`, 38px)**: Fixed height 38px, 1px bottom border `#e0e3eb`, button hitboxes 28px, centered 18px icons, and clean group dividers.
    2. **Left Drawing Toolbar (`#tv-left-toolbar`, 50px)**: Widened to standard 50px width; added top Crosshair cursor tool (`#cursor-tool-btn`); structured functional drawing group (Trendline, Parallel Channel, Fan Principle, Trend Structure, Dow Validation, Auto S/R, Ghost Candle); grouped with subtle horizontal dividers (`.tv-left-divider`); added `.tv-left-spacer` (`flex: 1`); pinned bottom utility tools: Magnet Mode toggle (`#magnet-tool-btn`, snaps crosshair to OHLC), Lock All Drawings (`#lock-drawings-btn`), Hide/Show All Drawings (`#hide-drawings-btn`), and Delete All Drawings (`#delete-drawings-btn`).
    3. **Right Tool Dock (`#right-dock`, 48px)**: Widened to 48px dock with clean 1px border `#e0e3eb`; top functional tools for Watchlist, Alerts, Running Trades, Movers, Financials, Broker Summary, and Calendar; separated via `.dock-spacer` (`flex: 1`) to bottom utility tools: Notifications (`#dock-notifications-btn`) and Help Center (`#dock-help-btn`).
    4. **Multi-Layered Chart Header (`#legend`, `.tv-chart-header`)**: Replaced flat single-line legend with structured 4-layer header:
       - **Title bar (`.tv-chart-title-row`)**: Circular asset badge (`#chart-asset-badge`), bold symbol name (`#header-ticker`), full company name (`#header-company-name`) with comprehensive `IDX_COMPANY_NAMES` dictionary, timeframe & market meta (`#header-market-meta`), and live market pulse dot (`#header-market-status`).
       - **Interactive Quick Quote Widget (`#tv-quote-widget`)**: Red Sell box (`#quick-sell-btn`, `#quote-sell-val`), center Spread pill (`#quote-spread-val`), blue Buy box (`#quick-buy-btn`, `#quote-buy-val`), and collapsible toggle chevron (`#quote-toggle-btn`).
       - **OHLC & Change Row (`#ohlc-legend-row`)**: Muted labels (`O`, `H`, `L`, `C`, `Prev`, `Chg`, `Vol`, `Val`, `Freq`, `Net.F`) and bold tabular values.
       - **Active Indicators Container (`#indicators-legend-container`)**: Retained for SMA, Ghost Candle, Volume, S/R, and other overlays.
    5. **Price Scale & Time Scale Framing (Grid & Gutters)**: Eliminated the amorphous white void by enabling subtle dotted grid lines (`#f0f3fa`, `LineStyle.Dotted`) across both vertical and horizontal planes; explicitly configured `borderColor: '#e0e3eb'` and `ticksVisible: true` on both `rightPriceScale` and `timeScale`; configured crosshair with `#9598a1` dashed lines and `#131722` badges.
    6. **Bottom Range Bar (`#tv-bottom-bar`, 34px)**: Upgraded to 34px height; date range pills (`1D`–`All`); integrated Calendar Jump Tool (`#date-picker-jump-btn`) with date picker input (`#date-picker-input`) to navigate directly to any date; Style horizon pills; live ticking Jakarta clock (`#bottom-clock`, `UTC+7 / WIB`); scale mode toggles (`%`, `log`, `auto`); and scale settings gear (`#bottom-gear-btn`).
- **Files Modified**:
  - `indicator-examples/src/my-footprint-ts/index.html`: Layout CSS and HTML structure for left toolbar, right dock, chart header, quote widget, and bottom bar.
  - `indicator-examples/src/my-footprint-ts/main.ts`: Chart options (grid, scales, crosshair), `IDX_COMPANY_NAMES` mapping, enhanced `updateOhlcLegend()`, and wired interactive event handlers for magnet, locking, hiding, deleting drawings, quote widget toggles, live clock, date picker jump, and scale modes.
- **Verification**: `npm run build` (`tsc`) compiled with 0 errors. Dev server serving HTTP 200 at `http://localhost:5173/src/my-footprint-ts/`.

