  - Restored `#tv-left-toolbar` to strictly host the core Dow Theory drawing tools and technical indicators:
    1. Trendline (`#auto-trendline-btn`)
    2. Parallel Channel (`#auto-channel-btn`)
    3. Fan Principle (`#auto-fan-btn`)
    4. Trend Structure (`#trend-structure-btn`)
    5. Dow Validation (`#dow-validation-btn`)
    6. Auto S/R (`#auto-sr-btn`)
    7. Ghost Candle (`#ghost-candle-btn`)
  - **Elements Removed**:
    - Left toolbar cursor tool (`#cursor-tool-btn`), dividers (`.tv-left-divider`), spacer (`.tv-left-spacer`), magnet mode (`#magnet-tool-btn`), lock drawings (`#lock-drawings-btn`), hide drawings (`#hide-drawings-btn`), delete drawings (`#delete-drawings-btn`).
