    1. **Outer Frame (Pigura)**:
       - **Top Toolbar (`#tv-header`)**: Pure white `#ffffff`, height 38px, crisp bottom border `1px solid #d1d4dc`.
       - **Left Toolbar (`#tv-left-toolbar`)**: Pure white `#ffffff`, width 50px, border `1px solid #d1d4dc`.
       - **Right Dock (`#right-dock`)**: Pure white `#ffffff`, width 48px, border `1px solid #d1d4dc`.
       - **Bottom Range Bar (`#tv-bottom-bar`)**: Pure white `#ffffff`, height 34px, border `1px solid #d1d4dc`.
